    "document": "Event Companion",
    "section": "Doubles Event Companion",
    "summary": "This companion supplements the Warhammer Event Companion for Doubles events, where teams of 2 players fight with their armies combined as one force against another team. It covers:\n\n- the Doubles mission sequence: changes to generating a mission and setting up the battlefield\n- Doubles terminology\n- Core Rules changes for playing beside a teammate\n\nFor everything else, such as errata, FAQs, pairing and ranking, use the Warhammer Event Companion; Doubles events pair and rank whole teams, not players.",
